@startuml
!pragma charset UTF-8
title Ring Design and Feasibility Triage Swimlane
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #FCF9F8
  BorderColor #807663
  ArrowColor #5B5E67
}

|Guest or Member|
start
:Choose ring-design option;
if (Approved catalogue model?) then (yes)
  |System|
  :Select confirmed feasible model;
  :Continue booking / consultation;
  stop
elseif (Approved component configurator?) then (yes)
  |System|
  :Validate selection against Owner-confirmed\ncomponent catalogue and hard constraints;
  :Continue booking / consultation;
  stop
else (Reference image)
  :Give explicit image-processing consent;
  :Submit reference image;
  |System|
  :Validate image request and rate limit;
  if (Consent and request accepted?) then (yes)
    |AI Vision API|
    :Return image quality and candidate features only;
    |System|
    :Apply Owner-configured hard constraints,\nscores and thresholds;
    if (Simple?) then (yes)
      :Auto-accept with auditable decision context;
      :Continue booking / consultation;
    elseif (Medium?) then (yes)
      |Staff / Consultant|
      :Review candidate features and feasibility;
      |System|
      :Record reviewed decision and audit context;
      :Continue or ask customer to choose again;
    elseif (Advanced?) then (yes)
      |Owner / Manager|
      :Review advanced request / override if authorised;
      |System|
      :Record decision, actor, reason and context;
      :Continue or ask customer to choose again;
    else (Impossible)
      :Auto-reject using approved constraint / threshold;
      :Ask customer to choose another idea;
    endif
  else (no)
    :Do not send image to AI;
    :Show consent / validation error;
  endif
endif

note right
AI does not make the final business decision, generate a design or decide price.
Numeric rules, evaluation evidence and provider remain TBD.
end note
stop
@enduml
